1
00:00:04,256 --> 00:00:05,799
<c.simplifiedchinese>相乐左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:05,884 --> 00:00:07,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>19岁</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:07,555 --> 00:00:11,934
<c.simplifiedchinese>万延元年
出生于信州农民家庭 是家中长子</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:12,021 --> 00:00:15,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>九岁时离开家加入赤报队</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:16,573 --> 00:00:20,118
<c.simplifiedchinese>他仰慕队长相乐总三 视其为师</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:20,204 --> 00:00:22,457
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而赤报队被污蔑为伪军</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:22,543 --> 00:00:24,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>总三被斩首</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:24,547 --> 00:00:26,841
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队解体</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:27,427 --> 00:00:31,556
<c.simplifiedchinese>后来他来到东京 成为了打手斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:31,644 --> 00:00:33,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>在黑道赢得了一些名声</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:33,607 --> 00:00:37,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>与浪客绯村剑心的激烈战斗中战败</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:37,573 --> 00:00:42,453
<c.simplifiedchinese>后来他便经常出入神谷道场
现在过着悠闲自在</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:45,293
<c.simplifiedchinese>游手好闲的生活</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:46,381 --> 00:00:47,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:49,471 --> 00:00:53,058
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:21,571 --> 00:02:22,447
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛牛锅 酒馆）</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:22,532 --> 00:02:23,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>锦绘？</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:23,742 --> 00:02:26,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>最近有新的锦绘上市了</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:27,083 --> 00:02:32,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>是很受欢迎的画师的作品
总是很快就卖光了</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:32,343 --> 00:02:36,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们又不能放下店里不管…</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:36,435 --> 00:02:39,730
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你想让我帮你去买</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:39,817 --> 00:02:42,236
<c.simplifiedchinese>是的 可以麻烦你吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:42,322 --> 00:02:43,865
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种事让弥彦去就好了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:43,950 --> 00:02:46,619
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也在工作啊 白痴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:46,705 --> 00:02:49,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>不像你个无业游民！</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:02:51,048 --> 00:02:54,259
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧 那我就帮你跑次腿吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:54,345 --> 00:02:56,681
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟你总请我免费吃饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:02:56,767 --> 00:02:58,602
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有请你啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:02:58,687 --> 00:03:00,981
<c.simplifiedchinese>至今为止所有的都记在账上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:01,068 --> 00:03:03,153
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种小事别在意了</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:03,238 --> 00:03:06,575
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么 你们想要谁画的什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:06,661 --> 00:03:10,499
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈津南的画作剑客“伊庭八郎”！</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:10,586 --> 00:03:15,633
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦 是幕末时期的人气美男剑客
独臂伊庭八郎啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:17,266 --> 00:03:18,476
<c.simplifiedchinese>请问…</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,394
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:21,650 --> 00:03:23,860
<c.simplifiedchinese>唔 不…没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:24,447 --> 00:03:27,075
<c.simplifiedchinese>想说什么直说比较好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:27,161 --> 00:03:29,288
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吧 小姑娘？</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:29,374 --> 00:03:30,416
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事…</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:31,128 --> 00:03:32,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:33,048 --> 00:03:37,302
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈津南画的伊庭八郎两张 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:38,809 --> 00:03:41,937
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不愧是阿左先生 男人就是不一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:42,024 --> 00:03:46,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的 他要是把饭钱付清就更好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:47,493 --> 00:03:50,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然现在友好的阿左先生很棒</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:50,708 --> 00:03:53,461
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是过去的他也很酷</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:03:53,547 --> 00:03:55,215
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 斩左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:03:55,801 --> 00:04:01,432
<c.simplifiedchinese>脸上笑着 但其实根本不满足的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:01,521 --> 00:04:04,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像马上要爆炸的炸弹！</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:05,779 --> 00:04:07,907
<c.simplifiedchinese>他总是那么耀眼</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:12,668 --> 00:04:14,003
<c.simplifiedchinese>锦绘</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:14,088 --> 00:04:15,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>在江户时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:15,216 --> 00:04:18,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>以演员画和风景画为主流</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:18,096 --> 00:04:19,515
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过进入明治时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:19,599 --> 00:04:24,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>开始描绘多种多样的题材
逐渐成为了大众文化</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:25,402 --> 00:04:30,950
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在锦绘已经成为了
展示明治文化和风俗的重要资料</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:32,041 --> 00:04:33,292
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎光临</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:33,377 --> 00:04:34,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>哟</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:34,837 --> 00:04:36,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左？</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:36,424 --> 00:04:38,260
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦 是你们俩</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:38,345 --> 00:04:40,305
<c.simplifiedchinese>来买锦绘吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:40,391 --> 00:04:42,059
<c.simplifiedchinese>真稀奇啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:04:42,645 --> 00:04:44,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道是买美人画？</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,400
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:04:45,484 --> 00:04:46,986
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许是买春宫图？</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:04:47,071 --> 00:04:47,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>天…</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:04:48,073 --> 00:04:49,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么可能啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:04:49,993 --> 00:04:52,829
<c.simplifiedchinese>是红牛的阿妙拜托我来跑腿</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:04:52,915 --> 00:04:54,125
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是买给我自己</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:04:54,794 --> 00:04:58,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>大叔 两张月冈津南的“伊庭八郎”
还有吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:04:58,594 --> 00:05:01,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>客人 你运气真好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:01,141 --> 00:05:03,226
<c.simplifiedchinese>那里还剩最后两张了</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:03,937 --> 00:05:05,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>津南的画很受欢迎</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:05,858 --> 00:05:07,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>总是很快就卖光了</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:07,778 --> 00:05:09,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>两张一共十钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:09,866 --> 00:05:12,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 我身上没钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:12,663 --> 00:05:13,831
<c.simplifiedchinese>借我点吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:13,915 --> 00:05:15,000
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:15,085 --> 00:05:20,049
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 我虽然听说过锦绘
但没想到有这么多种啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:05:20,137 --> 00:05:23,474
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末维新的人物画还挺多的啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,853
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:05:24,937 --> 00:05:29,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新志士、政府军官都很畅销
常被用作东京伴手礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:05:29,530 --> 00:05:31,532
<c.simplifiedchinese>像伊庭八郎这样的幕府人物</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:05:31,618 --> 00:05:33,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>在本地人里最受欢迎</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:05:34,415 --> 00:05:35,625
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:05:35,709 --> 00:05:36,627
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左？</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:05:36,711 --> 00:05:38,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:05:38,089 --> 00:05:39,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>相乐队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:05:40,886 --> 00:05:42,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 那个啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:05:42,848 --> 00:05:46,519
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是津南画的 但根本没人买</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:05:46,606 --> 00:05:49,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>但不知道为什么 他还是一直画</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:05:49,445 --> 00:05:51,489
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明是伪军的头目来着…</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:56,415
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈津南…</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:05:57,253 --> 00:05:58,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈…</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:01,970 --> 00:06:04,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙…人在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:05,602 --> 00:06:08,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>告诉我津南那家伙人在哪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:06:08,358 --> 00:06:09,234
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:06:09,318 --> 00:06:12,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>他在隔壁镇水沟边的大杂院里</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:06:12,658 --> 00:06:17,121
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他不喜欢跟人打交道
即使你去了 他也不会见你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:06:18,002 --> 00:06:18,919
<c.simplifiedchinese>他会的</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:06:20,966 --> 00:06:24,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙绝不可能不见我</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:06:28,899 --> 00:06:30,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>（月冈）</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:06:30,109 --> 00:06:31,277
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:06:31,362 --> 00:06:32,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:34,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在家吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:06:37,708 --> 00:06:38,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道你在家</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:06:39,002 --> 00:06:42,714
<c.simplifiedchinese>原赤报队预备队员 月冈克浩！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:06:42,801 --> 00:06:45,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>（月冈）</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:06:45,933 --> 00:06:46,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:06:47,686 --> 00:06:49,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是你画的 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:06:50,901 --> 00:06:53,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助？</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:06:53,532 --> 00:06:55,116
<c.simplifiedchinese>你到底是怎么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:06:55,201 --> 00:06:57,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看到这张画就明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:06:57,748 --> 00:07:02,169
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长身边的是小时候的你和我</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:02,258 --> 00:07:05,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>这张画不可能是别人画的</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:08,478 --> 00:07:09,437
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:09,522 --> 00:07:13,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>画师月冈津南也是赤报队的幸存者啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:16,116
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回去吧 薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:16,201 --> 00:07:21,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>看阿左有些异样我们才跟来的
不过现在应该没事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:07:21,963 --> 00:07:26,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且他现在还背着恶一字</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:07:26,179 --> 00:07:28,891
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队的经历对阿左来说
是特别的回忆</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:07:29,645 --> 00:07:33,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>回忆的世界里就不需要外人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:07:42,045 --> 00:07:45,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到你竟然成了画师啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:07:45,969 --> 00:07:49,097
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是啊 小时候你就很灵巧</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:07:49,184 --> 00:07:54,981
<c.simplifiedchinese>很难用的火炮跟火药的配制
都能信手拈来</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:07:55,071 --> 00:07:57,239
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 你现在做什么呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:07:58,327 --> 00:08:01,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>没做什么 就是到处闲逛</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:01,124 --> 00:08:03,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过也很快活</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:05,842 --> 00:08:06,927
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:08,390 --> 00:08:10,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>你过得很快活啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:12,146 --> 00:08:17,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>这十年来 我一次都没感到快活</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:17,115 --> 00:08:18,783
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年来 我一直痛恨着那些</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:18,868 --> 00:08:24,249
<c.simplifiedchinese>给相乐队长和赤报队伙伴
扣上污名的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:08:25,882 --> 00:08:29,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的性格变得比十年前还要阴暗了</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:30,391 --> 00:08:32,852
<c.simplifiedchinese>是不是到现在也没交到一个朋友？</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:33,732 --> 00:08:37,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 我十分理解你的心情</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:41,079 --> 00:08:43,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到 在我准备好一切的这天</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:43,877 --> 00:08:46,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然会跟你重逢</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:08:46,381 --> 00:08:52,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许是天上的队长在指引我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:08:52,310 --> 00:08:53,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:08:53,813 --> 00:08:54,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:08:54,982 --> 00:08:58,402
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不要和我再一次组建赤报队？</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:08:59,867 --> 00:09:03,496
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们一起推翻维新政府</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:04,167 --> 00:09:09,714
<c.simplifiedchinese>把相乐队长梦想中的新时代变为现实</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:16,651 --> 00:09:17,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:17,736 --> 00:09:20,030
<c.simplifiedchinese>你到底计划了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:20,116 --> 00:09:22,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>你问计划了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:22,328 --> 00:09:24,914
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队的目标只有一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:28,879
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就是队长一直梦想的
真正四民平等的新时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:28,967 --> 00:09:32,387
<c.simplifiedchinese>推翻碍事的明治政府</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:32,473 --> 00:09:38,354
<c.simplifiedchinese>你难道光顾着画锦绘
没听说过西南战争吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:38,443 --> 00:09:42,614
<c.simplifiedchinese>西乡隆盛是在日本边缘的鹿儿岛举兵</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:42,703 --> 00:09:46,206
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那里怎么打最终都是徒劳</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:09:46,293 --> 00:09:49,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>而我的目标是日本的中心</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:09:49,549 --> 00:09:52,260
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是这东京</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:09:52,346 --> 00:09:56,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>“内务省”统辖一切内政</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:09:57,064 --> 00:10:00,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一步就是要让它完全瘫痪</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:00,112 --> 00:10:01,697
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也想同时击溃陆海军省和财政部</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:01,782 --> 00:10:05,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我一个人是做不到的</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:05,874 --> 00:10:06,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:07,043 --> 00:10:09,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不相信外人</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:09,297 --> 00:10:12,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有的计划我会一个人实施</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:12,178 --> 00:10:15,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然我是一个人 但是我有这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:16,311 --> 00:10:18,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看 阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:18,190 --> 00:10:22,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>凭借在赤报队学到的火药兵器知识</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:22,198 --> 00:10:24,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>我做出了这些炸弹</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:24,410 --> 00:10:29,207
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我谨慎地避人耳目
花了十年做出的自信作品</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:29,295 --> 00:10:33,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>爆炸之后会起火
也能起到燃烧弹的作用</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:33,888 --> 00:10:38,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>用炸弹逐个爆破各个省厅
就能削弱中央的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:38,438 --> 00:10:41,858
<c.simplifiedchinese>全国各地
心存不满的士族和农民就会一起发难</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:10:41,946 --> 00:10:44,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>武装起义一触即发</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:10:44,492 --> 00:10:48,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>西南战争的消耗
让政府前所未有的虚弱</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:10:49,085 --> 00:10:52,130
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来只剩下等待雪崩般的溃败了</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:10:52,216 --> 00:10:53,884
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:10:53,970 --> 00:10:56,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个真正的四民平等的时代将来临</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:10:56,809 --> 00:10:58,978
<c.simplifiedchinese>最终洗刷队长和赤报队的污名</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:01,026 --> 00:11:02,986
<c.simplifiedchinese>行动就在明天</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:03,071 --> 00:11:05,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>人手最少的周日晚上</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:06,661 --> 00:11:09,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 我不想强迫你加入</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:09,752 --> 00:11:14,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>但作为原赤报队成员
我即使一个人也要行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:15,345 --> 00:11:18,140
<c.simplifiedchinese>明晚之前好好想想 给我答复</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:25,115 --> 00:11:26,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用的</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:26,409 --> 00:11:30,080
<c.simplifiedchinese>西南战争对明治政府造成的损耗再大</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:30,167 --> 00:11:35,172
<c.simplifiedchinese>一点炸弹和零散的起义
也无法撼动它的统治</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:35,762 --> 00:11:37,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年间 他一个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:37,515 --> 00:11:41,519
<c.simplifiedchinese>只想着洗刷赤报队和队长的污名</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:41,606 --> 00:11:43,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本看不到现在</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:11:48,286 --> 00:11:51,039
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:11:52,838 --> 00:11:54,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:11:55,134 --> 00:11:57,136
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明已经是春天了</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:11:57,721 --> 00:12:00,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>风还是这么冷</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:07,909 --> 00:12:09,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左？</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:16,384 --> 00:12:17,844
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:23,900 --> 00:12:25,651
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 修好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:26,529 --> 00:12:29,240
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你看
-谢谢队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:29,327 --> 00:12:32,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>用枪的时候叫上别的队员</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:32,416 --> 00:12:34,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>别一个人乱来</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:34,212 --> 00:12:35,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:35,631 --> 00:12:41,011
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过枪管歪成这样
还有这么高的命中率 很了不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:46,773
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不擅长用刀剑或者近战
所以至少想用好枪…</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:46,861 --> 00:12:48,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>真可靠啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:48,865 --> 00:12:51,493
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过并不需要这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:52,039 --> 00:12:55,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>克浩 你们应该努力学习</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:55,587 --> 00:12:57,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>学习？</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:57,716 --> 00:13:00,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀剑火炮的时代就快要结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:00,472 --> 00:13:04,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>之后就是知识与智慧的时代了</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:05,023 --> 00:13:06,858
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是属于你们的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:07,611 --> 00:13:10,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>去认识不同的人 增长见识</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:10,367 --> 00:13:13,287
<c.simplifiedchinese>我让你们跟着我就是为了这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:13,373 --> 00:13:16,001
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是我们想要保护队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:16,754 --> 00:13:20,216
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不想让你们做我的盾</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:20,304 --> 00:13:21,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>克浩</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:21,974 --> 00:13:24,226
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要和左之助要互相保护</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:24,312 --> 00:13:26,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>互相支撑走向未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:27,359 --> 00:13:30,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>随着时代变化 赤报队也会发生改变</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:30,198 --> 00:13:33,493
<c.simplifiedchinese>新的赤报队要由你们来创造</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:34,707 --> 00:13:36,709
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在也许对你们来说很难理解</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:37,671 --> 00:13:41,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>但总有一天你会明白我的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:43,350 --> 00:13:44,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:44,727 --> 00:13:50,608
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没能保护你 也没能适应新的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:51,407 --> 00:13:54,369
<c.simplifiedchinese>但请在天上见证 队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:54,455 --> 00:13:58,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>我为之奋斗十年的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:58,588 --> 00:14:01,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>和我创造的新赤报队</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:03,556 --> 00:14:04,641
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:04,725 --> 00:14:08,396
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说月冈津南是你的老朋友？</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:08,483 --> 00:14:11,111
<c.simplifiedchinese>你听起来好像并不惊讶啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:11,197 --> 00:14:14,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然惊讶啦 是不是啊 薰小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:14,286 --> 00:14:15,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊 剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:15,956 --> 00:14:17,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:17,918 --> 00:14:21,463
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之我们准备开个重逢宴会庆祝一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:21,551 --> 00:14:24,721
<c.simplifiedchinese>你介意今晚借用一下道场吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:24,807 --> 00:14:29,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>我倒是不介意 但是你哪来的钱呢…</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:30,068 --> 00:14:32,362
<c.simplifiedchinese>你别想再让我给你付账了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:32,448 --> 00:14:34,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>不行 绝对不行！</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:34,368 --> 00:14:37,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说 不用担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:37,499 --> 00:14:39,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>钱的事交给我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:39,211 --> 00:14:41,756
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就拜托你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:41,841 --> 00:14:45,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>对啦 把阿妙和小姑娘也叫上</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:45,807 --> 00:14:48,226
<c.simplifiedchinese>她们应该会很开心</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:51,319 --> 00:14:52,278
<c.simplifiedchinese>好奇怪</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:52,362 --> 00:14:53,530
<c.simplifiedchinese>好奇怪 太奇怪了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:53,615 --> 00:14:56,159
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助是不是生什么病了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:57,414 --> 00:14:59,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静点</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:59,126 --> 00:15:01,003
<c.simplifiedchinese>春天来了啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:15,867 --> 00:15:18,328
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我们开始吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:18,414 --> 00:15:21,709
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么啊 你说钱的事交给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:21,796 --> 00:15:24,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来就是让津南先生出钱啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:24,802 --> 00:15:27,263
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:27,349 --> 00:15:28,433
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:28,518 --> 00:15:32,438
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好意思 我们可以一起吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:32,526 --> 00:15:34,278
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:34,363 --> 00:15:37,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么说的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:39,665 --> 00:15:41,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>你来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:41,252 --> 00:15:43,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起…我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:43,673 --> 00:15:46,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经过去了 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:46,637 --> 00:15:49,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果阿左先生不介意 我们也没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:49,685 --> 00:15:51,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:52,441 --> 00:15:53,692
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:53,776 --> 00:15:58,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>宵太喜欢赌博
喜欢小孩子们和女性的笑容</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:58,369 --> 00:16:01,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>有兴趣的话 去他墓前看看吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:16:01,626 --> 00:16:03,294
<c.simplifiedchinese>她已经去过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:03,379 --> 00:16:04,547
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:04,632 --> 00:16:05,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:11,019 --> 00:16:13,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左先生 这到底是什么宴会？</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:13,858 --> 00:16:16,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>你请客还是第一回啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:17,156 --> 00:16:19,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种小事不要在意</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:19,286 --> 00:16:22,915
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我们不醉不归！</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:36,362 --> 00:16:41,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到津南和阿左先生是发小啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:41,204 --> 00:16:44,499
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左先生小时候什么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:44,586 --> 00:16:46,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:46,089 --> 00:16:48,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:48,761 --> 00:16:50,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没怎么变</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:50,097 --> 00:16:54,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>总是那么冒失
不会想那么多 跟着直觉走</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:54,606 --> 00:16:56,900
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 真像他啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:56,986 --> 00:17:01,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像一旦爆炸就无法阻止的炸弹一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:01,161 --> 00:17:02,746
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 果然啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:02,831 --> 00:17:04,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想让我勒死你吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:04,918 --> 00:17:06,128
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:06,630 --> 00:17:10,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>关键时刻他也很靠得住</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:18,195 --> 00:17:20,155
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常感谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,992
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会当作家宝珍藏的</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:23,288 --> 00:17:24,956
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常感谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:25,042 --> 00:17:26,376
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用谢我</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:26,462 --> 00:17:28,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>让他给你画张像吧 阿左先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:28,549 --> 00:17:29,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就不用了</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:29,676 --> 00:17:32,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是小屁孩的时候
他已经画了很多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:32,181 --> 00:17:36,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>他总是画我鼻青脸肿
满身伤疤的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:36,106 --> 00:17:37,315
<c.simplifiedchinese>真丢人</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:40,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只是如实画罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:40,782 --> 00:17:42,534
<c.simplifiedchinese>真像阿左先生啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:42,619 --> 00:17:44,830
<c.simplifiedchinese>那画绯村先生呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:46,209 --> 00:17:47,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下就不用了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:47,629 --> 00:17:49,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么关系啊？就让他画一张</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:49,758 --> 00:17:51,635
<c.simplifiedchinese>就当酒席上的小游戏啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:55,979 --> 00:17:58,022
<c.simplifiedchinese>你和左之助是什么关系？</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:17:58,651 --> 00:18:00,153
<c.simplifiedchinese>朋友</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:00,237 --> 00:18:02,531
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为一点争斗认识的</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:02,617 --> 00:18:04,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说你是个浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:05,498 --> 00:18:06,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以前是做什么的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:07,752 --> 00:18:09,421
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下当时在西边</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:11,092 --> 00:18:12,135
<c.simplifiedchinese>京都？</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:16,019 --> 00:18:18,730
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新志士吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:21,279 --> 00:18:22,655
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:22,741 --> 00:18:24,868
<c.simplifiedchinese>正是</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:27,751 --> 00:18:29,044
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:29,671 --> 00:18:33,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我第一次给维新志士画像</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:33,094 --> 00:18:34,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>都是过去的事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:34,932 --> 00:18:37,017
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下现在只是一介浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:37,102 --> 00:18:38,729
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:40,944 --> 00:18:42,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>画好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:43,741 --> 00:18:45,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 没有五官？</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:45,787 --> 00:18:48,206
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只画我看见的东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:48,291 --> 00:18:49,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看不清这个男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:50,003 --> 00:18:55,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>看不清在他的笑容和伤疤后
究竟隐藏着什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:18:59,898 --> 00:19:04,027
<c.simplifiedchinese>但有这个伤疤就可以认出是在下啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:08,791 --> 00:19:10,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左先生 多谢你请客</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:10,878 --> 00:19:13,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次来我家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:13,216 --> 00:19:15,051
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 我会的</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:16,055 --> 00:19:17,390
<c.simplifiedchinese>路上小心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:18,101 --> 00:19:21,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>知道啦 那明天见 阿左先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:22,819 --> 00:19:24,946
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 明天见</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:36,137 --> 00:19:37,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:38,099 --> 00:19:40,060
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们差不多该出发了</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:40,145 --> 00:19:42,356
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后的晚餐</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:42,441 --> 00:19:44,568
<c.simplifiedchinese>你吃得尽兴吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:44,654 --> 00:19:48,408
<c.simplifiedchinese>并没有
我不是抱着那种打算开的宴会</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:48,495 --> 00:19:52,123
<c.simplifiedchinese>红牛的人和小姑娘她们
平时请我吃了很多饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:52,712 --> 00:19:54,881
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个算是还礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:54,966 --> 00:19:56,593
<c.simplifiedchinese>修和银次…</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:56,678 --> 00:19:58,639
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 只是顺便</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:58,724 --> 00:20:00,559
<c.simplifiedchinese>你呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:20:00,644 --> 00:20:02,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>玩得开心吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:03,274 --> 00:20:04,734
<c.simplifiedchinese>完全不开心</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:20:04,820 --> 00:20:05,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:20:05,738 --> 00:20:07,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看你聊得很开心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:20:09,078 --> 00:20:11,288
<c.simplifiedchinese>你确定要加入吗 左之助？</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:20:11,374 --> 00:20:12,542
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:20:12,626 --> 00:20:15,421
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可不是那种懦弱的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:20:16,300 --> 00:20:17,260
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:20:18,430 --> 00:20:23,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>你抛弃了现在的生活
选择了赤报队 我从心底感谢你</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:20:25,862 --> 00:20:26,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>快走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:20:26,905 --> 00:20:29,533
<c.simplifiedchinese>再磨蹭下去天就亮了</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:20:32,666 --> 00:20:35,252
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起啊 大家</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:20:35,338 --> 00:20:37,299
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没奢望大家能理解我</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:20:38,136 --> 00:20:41,514
<c.simplifiedchinese>对我来说 赤报队果然是特别的</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:20:42,102 --> 00:20:48,484
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 下次再见面时
我已经犯下重罪了</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:20:48,573 --> 00:20:53,286
<c.simplifiedchinese>你用逆刃刀来制服我也没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:22:47,811 --> 00:22:50,605
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《津南与锦绘》</c.simplifiedchinese>

